// Title: Suspicious Execution From Outlook Temporary Folder
// Sigma ID: a018fdc3-46a3-44e5-9afb-2cd4af1d4b39
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2019-10-01 | Modified: 2022-10-09
// ATT&CK: initial-access, T1566.001
// Description: Detects a suspicious program execution in Outlook temp folder
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - Internal Research
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_office_outlook_execution_from_temp.yml
